---
args: {"item": "EvidenceItem", "releases": "LocalizationRelease[]"}
returns: "ContextSegment[]"
---
Identify distinct communicative uses of identical strings from product context, audience, grammatical role and surrounding content. An action button and status label require separate context keys even when a source word matches. Preserve polysemous concept/sense distinctions such as a device operation versus a billing charge. Bind each segment to actual source/version evidence and retain unknown context as a question.
